  - m_Id: 5785351177879552
    m_Localized: 'Queen''s Chamber: laying eggs that you can use for building buildings,
      raising new ants, improving constructions, etc.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5788548160274432
    m_Localized: 'Storage and garden of fungi: where food and construction materials
      are kept. Additionally, food will be produced periodically thanks to the fungi
      that grow here.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5788484306190336
    m_Localized: 'Breeding room: to create different types of ants. Each one requires
      specific resources to grow and serves different purposes.

      The worker
      ants will not leave the anthill, but they will be responsible for transporting
      materials and guarding inside.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
